For the following gas phase equilibrium reaction at constant temperature,
$\mathrm{NH_3(g) = 1/2\,N_2(g) + 3/2\,H_2(g)}$
if the total pressure is $\sqrt{3}$ atm and the pressure equilibrium constant ($\mathrm{K_p}$) is 9 atm , then the degree of dissociation is given as $(x \times 10^{-2})^{-1/2}$. The value of x is ______ (nearest integer)
